  VALUES ('bio_biochem', 'The Musculoskeletal System', 'Bone Remodeling & Calcium Homeostasis', 'A researcher infuses two thyroid/parathyroid hormones separately into anesthetized rats and records bone osteoclast activity and the resulting change in blood \(\text{Ca}^{2+}\):

